# Stdlib-only (user-agent)

This module must remain dependency-free beyond the Go standard library.

- Do not add `require` entries to `go.mod` for third-party modules.
- Do not introduce assertion libraries, HTTP frameworks, or UA parsers.
- Tests use stdlib `testing` only; put **got before want** in failure messages.
- Prefer shell/`go test`/`golangci-lint` for verification over new tooling deps.
- If a change seems to need an external library, stop and ask; redesign with
  stdlib instead.
